   "why": "no sentence clips"
  },
  {
   "id": "zho_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S001",
   "pod": "zho_for_eng:pod-1",
   "scene": 22,
   "speaker": "Learner",
   "target": "你介意我试着用中文跟你练习说话吗？我学习的时间还不长，跟别人说话的时候还是觉得有点紧张。",
   "known": "Would you mind if I tried to practise speaking Chinese with you? I haven't been learning for very long, and I still feel a little nervous about speaking with other people.",
   "targetAudioId": "8765680a-0716-4bae-b168-96cd752d464a",
   "knownAudioId": "1ceec09a-084b-49a1-a018-f2409f5bff35",
   "targetVoice": "xai_33g9t0jl",
   "knownVoice": "xai_bedd6226",
   "wordTimings": null,
   "knownWordTimings": null,
   "chunks": [],
   "kind": "whole-turn",
   "why": "no sentence clips"
  },
  {
   "id": "zho_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S003",
   "pod": "zho_for_eng:pod-1",
   "scene": 22,
   "speaker": "Learner",
   "target": "谢谢你，听到这个我很高兴。我需要学更多的词，也需要练习听。别人说话不慢的时候我听不太懂。",
   "known": "Thank you, that's good to know. I need to learn more words, and I need to practise listening. I don't understand people very well when they don't speak slowly.",
   "targetAudioId": "f41e2c25-2b1a-47f5-a15f-60291942df1d",
   "knownAudioId": "7a3158f1-85a1-4179-a456-c9e1c685e9cb",
   "targetVoice": "xai_33g9t0jl",
   "knownVoice": "bedd6226",
   "wordTimings": null,
   "knownWordTimings": null,
   "chunks": [],
   "kind": "whole-turn",
   "why": "no sentence clips"
  },
  {
   "id": "zho_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S005",
   "pod": "zho_for_eng:pod-1",
   "scene": 22,
   "speaker": "Learner",
   "target": "是的，谢谢你。只跟一个人说话更容易一些。不过想该说什么还是有点难。我不太确定该说什么，但我感觉我能说够多的话来开始聊天了。",
   "known": "Yes, thank you. It's easier talking to just one person. It's a bit difficult thinking of something to say, though. I'm not sure what to say, but I feel as if I can speak enough to start having conversations.",
   "targetAudioId": "8d800330-8ba0-406b-af4e-edeb6010c852",
   "knownAudioId": "45297656-d3c2-4718-b437-ad332aae3934",
   "targetVoice": "xai_33g9t0jl",
   "knownVoice": "bedd6226",
   "wordTimings": null,
   "knownWordTimings": null,
   "chunks": [],
   "kind": "whole-turn",
   "why": "no sentence clips"
  },
  {
   "id": "zho_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S007",
   "pod": "zho_for_eng:pod-1",
   "scene": 22,
   "speaker": "Learner",
   "target": "就是有时候想得不够快，没办法好好表达自己，这让我有点沮丧。但我知道如果想说得更自信，就需要一直练习。",
   "known": "It's just a little frustrating when I can't think quickly enough to express myself properly. But I know that I need to keep practising if I want to speak more confidently.",
   "targetAudioId": "d038229c-0d76-4600-a8e3-63158f7a6a1f",
   "knownAudioId": "4bc1fa66-73b3-4873-ad0e-1f9748630bb3",
   "targetVoice": "xai_33g9t0jl",
   "knownVoice": "bedd6226",
   "wordTimings": null,
   "knownWordTimings": null,
   "chunks": [],
   "kind": "whole-turn",
   "why": "no sentence clips"
  },
  {
   "id": "zho_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S009",
   "pod": "zho_for_eng:pod-1",
   "scene": 22,
   "speaker": "Learner",
   "target": "这正是我需要的那种练习。我觉得我能感觉到我们说话的时候我的大脑在变化！真的很感谢你的帮助。不过用一门自己说得不太好的语言说话，会累得出乎意料。",
   "known": "This is exactly the kind of practice I need. I think I can feel it changing my brain while we're talking! I really appreciate your help. But it's surprising how tired I get when I'm talking in a language I don't speak very well.",
   "targetAudioId": "90a2e0ca-22c3-45e0-b74f-5e287bc23244",
   "knownAudioId": "2727ee78-5157-489a-b240-d7cbf06942e9",
   "targetVoice": "xai_33g9t0jl",
   "knownVoice": "bedd6226",
   "wordTimings": null,
   "knownWordTimings": null,
   "chunks": [],
   "kind": "whole-turn",
   "why": "no sentence clips"
  },
  {
   "id": "zho_for_eng:pod-1:SC22-S011",
   "pod": "zho_for_eng:pod-1",
   "scene": 22,
   "speaker": "Learner",
   "target": "确实是这样。我真的很高兴我能聊这么多。我也希望随着我越来越好，我们以后能有更多的对话。",
   "known": "It really is. I'm really happy that I can have this much of a conversation. And I hope we'll be able to have more conversations in the future as I keep on getting better.",
   "targetAudioId": "3baf1722-2c5b-4532-bc70-2d7dd6ed9a4e",
   "knownAudioId": "8fcd2ddc-cd51-4ead-a7a8-dea652da77be",
